  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p>At Velumize, we're more than just a beauty brand; we're a movement for conscious beauty. We believe that radiant skin and a healthy planet go hand-in-hand, and we strive to craft products that embody both.</p>\r\n<p>Velumize sprang from a yearning for beauty that was as effective as it was ethical. We were tired of the harsh chemicals and exploitative practices often plaguing the industry, and we knew there had to be a better way.</p>\r\n<h2 class=\"image-with-text__heading h2\">Our Philosophy</h2>\r\n<div class=\"image-with-text__text rte body\">\r\n<p>At Velumize, we believe beauty isn't something imposed, it's something revealed. It's the sun-kissed glow on your skin, the confidence sparkling in your eyes, the joy radiating from within. We're not here to mask or cover, but to empower you to unveil your own unique radiance.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Nature's Canvas:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>We harness the earth's bounty &ndash; botanicals bursting with efficacy and purity &ndash; to craft products that nurture your skin and awaken its natural potential. Every jar, bottle, and tube is a celebration of nature's beauty, a reminder that the most powerful ingredients are often the simplest.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Compassionate Beauty:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Velumize embraces a world where beauty knows no cruelty. We are vegan and cruelty-free, extending our compassion beyond formulas to embrace sustainable and ethical practices in every step of our journey. We believe that conscious choices create a ripple effect of good, both for you and the planet.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Empowering Confidence:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>More than just products, Velumize offers a philosophy. We invite you to celebrate your unique beauty, to listen to your skin's needs, and to discover the confidence that blossoms when you nurture your natural radiance. We believe in holistic well-being, offering resources and education that extend beyond the surface to nourish your body, mind, and spirit.</p>\r\n<p>Join us on this journey of unveiling your natural brilliance. Choose Velumize, and choose beauty that shines both inside and out.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--16682099605703__bfeff9eb-56c8-4ad8-a726-07b107f696ae\" class=\"shopify-section spaced-section spaced-section--full-width\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text color-background-1 gradient rich-text--full-width\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text__blocks\">\r\n<div class=\"rich-text__text rte\">\r\n<p>Velumize products are crafted with&nbsp;<strong>love for you and the planet</strong>.&nbsp;We're&nbsp;<strong>vegan, cruelty-free, and committed to ethically sourced ingredients</strong>.&nbsp;All while harnessing nature's power to deliver&nbsp;<strong>high-performance skincare that ignites your natural radiance</strong>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--16682099605703__1705935570329a73d7\" class=\"shopify-section spaced-section\">\r\n<div class=\"page-width\">\r\n<div id=\"shopify-block-viaglamour_cosmetics_skincare_block_rNykdV\" class=\"shopify-block shopify-app-block\">\r\n<div id=\"viaglamour-skincare\" data-id=\"\" class=\"viaglamour-app-extension tw-w-full tw-py-10 sm:tw-flex sm:tw-flex-col sm:tw-py-18\">\r\n<section class=\"tw-grid tw-items-center tw-grid-cols-2 tw-mx-auto tw-gap-x-8 tw-gap-y-10 sm:tw-grid-cols-3 sm:tw-gap-x-10 lg:tw-mx-0 lg:tw-max-w-none\">\r\n<div class=\"text-sm tw-max-w-xs tw-text-lg tw-font-medium tw-sr-only tw-invisible\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/avocado-oil.png\" alt=\"avocado-oil viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Avocado Oil</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Avocado Oil deeply penetrates in the skin and provides comfort and nutrition to lips.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/vitamin-e.png\" alt=\"vitamin-e viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Vitamin E</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Vitamin E help to soothe and even the appearance of skin tone.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/jojoba-oil.png\" alt=\"jojoba-oil viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Jojoba Oil</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Jojoba Oil form a barrier that effectively locks the moisture in and keeps the skin soft and supple.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/coconut-oil.png\" alt=\"coconut-oil viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Coconut Oil</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Coconut Oil create a barrier and lock in moisture so your lips remain free of cracks.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/multi-peptide-complex.png\" alt=\"multi-peptide-complex viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Multi Peptide Complex</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">A dual peptide system composed of chains of amino acids that promotes the formation of new collagen.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/sugar-crystals.png\" alt=\"sugar-crystals viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Sugar Crystals</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">It gently buffs away dry flakes with sugar crystals and natural humectants, while conditioning chapped lips.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/botanical-extracts.png\" alt=\"botanical-extracts viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Botanical Extracts</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Botanical Extracts has strong activity regenerating and repairing connective layer, especially on wrinkles.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/grape-seed-oil.png\" alt=\"grape-seed-oil viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Grape Seed Oil</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Grape Seed Oil is full of antioxidants which nourishes the skin.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/shea-butter.png\" alt=\"shea-butter viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Shea Butter</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Formulated with Organic Shea Butter and Coconut Oil which moisturizes, softens and heals dry, damaged skin.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-flex tw-flex-col tw-justify-between tw-h-full\">\r\n<div class=\"tw-w-auto tw-col-span-1\"><img class=\"tw-w-auto tw-h-full tw-mx-auto\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/extensions/7091816f-53e0-49ca-8492-3ae287fb7d34/1.27.0/assets/vitamin-c.png\" alt=\"vitamin-c viaGlamour private-label cosmetics\" loading=\"lazy\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"tw-max-w-sm sm:tw-max-w-none tw-col-span-1 sm:mt-4\">\r\n<h2 class=\"tw-font-medium tw-text-left\">Vitamin C</h2>\r\n<p class=\"tw-mt-4 lg:mt-8 sm:tw-pt-4 tw-leading-snug tw-text-left\">Best-selling vegan liquid lipstick formulas are infused Vitamin C, Vitamin E, and natural avocado oil.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
